=== rules/no-console.yml (ast-grep, copy-once true)
# Written once by gragas from the rulebook. It is yours to edit: gragas does not write it again.
id: no-console
rule:
  pattern: "console.log($A)"
severity: error
=== rules/no-eval.yml (ast-grep, copy-once true)
# Written once by gragas from the rulebook. It is yours to edit: gragas does not write it again.
id: no-eval
rule:
  pattern: "eval($A)"
severity: warning
=== sgconfig.yml (ast-grep, copy-once true)
# Written once by gragas from the rulebook. It is yours to edit: gragas does not write it again.
ruleDirs:
  - rules
